# Agent tooling - local-only, never pushed, never published.
# AGENTS.md is intentionally NOT ignored anymore: it is tracked in git so it syncs
# across devices, but it lives at the repo root (outside content/) so Quartz never
# publishes it.
# Anchored to the repo root: unanchored `scripts/` also matched
# `quartz/components/scripts/`, which silently kept new Quartz component scripts
# out of git and out of the deployed build.
/scripts/
.claudian/